    },
    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Steel cuirass with brass edge trim, a raised brass star on the chest, three articulated lame bands at the waist, leather shoulder straps with brass buckles and paired side straps with buckles. The top and bottom views confirm it is a hollow shell with real wall thickness and open neck and arm holes, so it can be fitted over a torso. The back plate and all strap runs are complete. Unrigged static prop.",
    "limitations": [
      "The waist lames are fused and will not articulate independently.",
      "Sized as a standalone prop; it may need scaling to fit a specific character torso."
    ],
